DSM::constructor
├── when passing valid hat id
│   └── it deploys and sets GENERAL_ADMIN_HAT_ID
└── when passing invalid hat id
    └── it reverts with NotActive


DSM::unlockContractExecution
├── when called by general admin with registered contract
│   ├── it updates nextExpiry to current timestamp + executionPeriod
│   └── it emits UnlockContractExecution event
├── when called by general admin with unregistered contract
│   └── it reverts with NotRegistered
└── when called by non-general admin
    └── it reverts with NotAuthorized


DSM::registerContract
├── when called by general admin with active hat
│   ├── when passing valid parameters
│   │   ├── it sets contract as registered
│   │   ├── it sets execution parameters correctly
│   │   ├── it sets nextExpiry to 0
│   │   └── it emits RegisterContract event
│   └── when passing zero execution period
│       ├── it still registers the contract
│       ├── it sets execution parameters correctly
│       └── it emits RegisterContract event
├── when called by general admin with inactive hat
│   └── it reverts with NotActive
└── when called by non-general admin
    └── it reverts with NotAuthorized


DSM::generalAdminHatId
└── when called
    └── it returns the correct general admin hat ID